    "sections": {
        "description": "STPsychology is a modern and professional WordPress theme designed for psychologists, therapists, counselors, mental health clinics, and wellness coaches. It features a clean, calming layout that helps build trust and present services clearly. The theme includes responsive design, customizable homepage sections, appointment booking support, testimonial areas, blog layouts, and SEO-friendly coding. Easy customization options allow users to change colors, fonts, and layouts without coding knowledge. Psychology is lightweight, fast-loading, and compatible with popular plugins such as Elementor, Contact Form 7, and WooCommerce. Perfect for creating a strong online presence for mental health professionals and therapy practices worldwide."
    },
